    "text": "Wynfl\u00e6d cy\u00f0 hu hio wile ymbe \u00fe\u00e6t hio h\u00e6f\u00f0 ofer hyre d\u00e6g.\nHio becwi\u00fe into cyrcan hyre ofring & hyre beteran ofringsceat & hyre rode & into beodern hiwun twa\n& hio becwi\u00f0 \u00c6\u00f0elfl\u00e6de hyre dehter hyre agrafenan beah & hyre mentelpreon & \u00fe\u00e6t land \u00e6t\n& hio an hyre \u00feara manna & \u00fe\u00e6s yrfes & ealles \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r \u00feenne on bi\u00f0 butan \u00fe\u00e6t man scel for hyre\n& \u00e6t Ceorlatune hio hyre an ealswa \u00feere manna & \u00fe\u00e6s yrfes butan \u00feam freotmannon & \u00fe\u00e6t man finde\n& hio an him eac \u00fe\u00e6s landes \u00e6t Faccancumbe \u00fee hyre morgengyfu wes his d\u00e6g & ofer his d\u00e6g gyf\n& gif god wille \u00fe\u00e6t Eadwold weor\u00fee to \u00feam gewexen an his f\u00e6der d\u00e6ge \u00fe\u00e6t he land healdan m\u00e6ge\n& hio wile \u00fe\u00e6t man finde \u00e6t Inggeneshamme healfes pundes wyr\u00fene saulsceat to Waneting for hy & \u00e6t\n& freoge man Wulfware folgyge \u00feam \u00fee hyre leofost sy ttry\u00f0e ealswa.\n& freoge man Wulffl\u00e6de on \u00fe\u00e6t gerad \u00fe\u00e6t hio folgige \u00c6\u00feelfl\u00e6de & Eadgyfe.\n& hio becwi\u00f0 Eadgyfe ane crencestran & ane semestran, o\u00feer hatte Edgyfu o\u00feer hatte \u00c6\u00feelyfu.\n& freoge man Gerburge & Miscin & Hil & Burhulfes dohtur \u00e6t Cinnuc & \u00c6lfsige & his wif & his\n& \u00e6t Ceorlatune freoge man Pifus & Edwyn & wif.\n& \u00e6t Faccancumbe frioge man Edelm & Man & Iohannan & Sprow & his wif & Enf & Gersande &\n& \u00e6t Colleshylle freoge man \u00c6\u00feelgy\u00fee & Bican wif & \u00c6ffan & Bedan & Gurhannes wif & freoge man\n& gif \u00fe\u00e6r hwylc wite\u00feeow man sy butan \u00feyson \u00fee hio ge\u00feeowede hio gelyf\u00f0 to hyre bearnon \u00fe\u00e6t hi\n& \u00c6lfwolde hyre twegen wesendhornas & an hors & hyre reade geteld.\n& hio becwy\u00f0 Eadm\u00e6re ane hlidf\u00e6s\u00fee cuppan, o\u00fere \u00c6\u00f0elfl\u00e6de & bit \u00fe\u00e6t hi findon betweox him twa\n\u00deonne wolde hio \u00fe\u00e6t man dyde innon \u00c6g\u00feere cuppan healf pund penega & agyfe man Eadwolde his\n& hio becwi\u00f0 him hyre goldfagan treowenan cuppan \u00fe\u00e6t he ice his beah mid \u00feam golde o\u00fe\u00fee hi mon \u00e6t\n& hio becwi\u00fe him twa mydrecan & \u00fe\u00e6raninnan an bedreaf, eal \u00fe\u00e6t to anum bedde gebyre\u00f0.\n& agyfe Eadm\u00e6r Eadwolde swa micel yrfe & swa fela manna swa him \u00e6r \u00e6t Hafene becw\u00e6\u00f0 & he his\n& be \u00fean lande \u00e6t Cinnuc, hit agon \u00fea hiwan \u00e6t Sceaftesbyrig ofer hyre d\u00e6g & hio ah \u00fe\u00e6t yrfe & \u00fea\n\u00deenne an hio \u00fean hywum \u00feara gebura \u00fee on \u00feam gafollande sitta\u00f0 & \u00feera \u00feeowra manna hio an hyre\n& hio wile \u00fe\u00e6t man l\u00e6te on \u00fean lande standan VI oxsan & IIII cy mid feower cealfon.\n& of \u00feam \u00feeowan mannan \u00e6t Cinnuc hio becwi\u00f0 Eadwolde Ceolstan Etstanes sunu & \u00c6ffan sunu &\n& hio becwi\u00fe Eadgyfe \u00fe\u00e6rangean \u00c6lfsige \u00feene coc & \u00c6lfware Burgan dohtor & Herestan & his wif &\n& hio becwi\u00f0 \u00c6\u00f0elfl\u00e6de Elhhelmmes dehter \u00c6lfferes dohtor \u00fea geonran & hyre twilibrocenan cyrtel &\n& Eadgyfe twa mydrecan & \u00fe\u00e6raninnan hyre bets\u00fee bedwahrift & linnenne ruwan & eal \u00fe\u00e6t bedref \u00fee\n& sylle man hyre IIII mancussas of hyre sa bege & an lang healwahrift & o\u00feer sceort & \u00ferio sethr\u00e6gl.\n& hio an Ceoldry\u00fee hyre blacena tunecena swa \u00feer hyre leofre beo & hyre bets\u00f0 haliryft & hyre bets\u00fean\n& \u00fe\u00e6r synt twa micle mydercan & an hr\u00e6glcys\u00f0 & an lytulu towmyderce & eac twa ealde mydercan.\n\u00deenne an hio \u00c6\u00feelfl\u00e6de on \u00e6lcum \u00feingum \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r unbecweden bi\u00f0 on bocum & an swilcum lytlum &\n& \u00fe\u00e6r synt eac wahriftu sum \u00fee hyre wyr\u00f0e bi\u00f0 & \u00fea l\u00e6stan hio m\u00e6g syllan hyre wimmannon.\n& hio becwi\u00f0 Cynelufe hyre d\u00e6l \u00feera wildera horsa \u00fee mid Eadm\u00e6res synt.\n& hio an \u00c6\u00feelflede hyre hy & \u00feara andlumena & ealra \u00feera get\u00e6sa \u00feet \u00fe\u00e6rbinnan beo\u00f0 & eac \u00f0\u00e6s\n& h\u00e6bbe Eadwold & his sweostor hyre taman hors gem\u00e6n his agene toforan.",
